  "html": "<a name=\"Build_110\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Build 110 </span></h2>\n<p>I had a screen capture of the cost but lost the damned thing... It's now somewhere's around 82k per SINGLE kc for level 100.\n</p><p>FreaksGirl has been logging runs:<br/>\n</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"30%\">\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left;\">\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><b>March 3-13, 2008 Runs, Ratsputin's Level 3</b>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>216 </td><td> No Sally\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>127</td><td> Regular Sally\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>48 </td><td>KC Sally\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9 </td><td>RB Sally\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> 400 runs <b>Total</b>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td><td width=\"1%\">\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td> \n</td></tr></table>\n</td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"20%\">\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left;\">\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Frequency:\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>46 % </td><td> <b>Any</b> Sally\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>31.8 %</td><td> Regular Sally\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12 %</td><td>KC Sally\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.25 %</td><td>RB Sally\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td><td>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td> \n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>--<a href=\"/wiki/User:Spetsdod\" title=\"User:Spetsdod\">Spetsdod</a> 15:23, 14 March 2008 (CET)\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
